  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/POiT8xvIKvg\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></p><p><strong>使用文言-华夏（lzh）以获得增强体验</strong></p><p><strong>使用&nbsp;文言-华夏 以获更佳之体验</strong></p><p>新增传奇武器：<strong>爱国者</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1011068/description_e3ba962d-bed2-4fd7-938a-e495d09fffa4.png\"></p><p>按下<strong>Shift键</strong>查看连招信息。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1011068/description_f9ad8556-db3e-4ffa-9110-a3202d20a413.png\" width=\"578\" height=\"304\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>如果您安装了<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-skill-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">史诗战斗：技能树</a>，本模组会为御剑飞行提供默认技能树。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1011068/description_d3ca7e7f-83d3-405c-a526-63faaebadad6.png\"></p><p>为史诗战斗添加若干剑术技能，特别是御剑飞行。</p><p>您可以使用<a href=\"https://github.com/GaylordFockerCN/SwordSoaring-Reborn/blob/1.20.1-20.12/src/main/java/net/p1nero/ss/gameassets/SwordSoaringLivingMotions.java\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">御剑飞行动态动作</a>为自定义武器设置专属的御剑飞行动画。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1011068/description_07590108-40f6-49c0-aa2a-8111c16428b9.png\" width=\"429\" height=\"417\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1011068/description_c7a2bcaa-4fa0-4e6f-8479-3c5811bb54cd.png\" width=\"430\" height=\"423\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1011068/description_5e18b0f7-906c-42dd-b70f-bd0d558f0b88.png\" width=\"430\" height=\"444\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1011068/description_8b39c607-9412-4c1b-9f7b-d74448f6dada.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1011068/description_391e16ac-10cb-4868-a522-ed48c21d4897.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1011068/description_0882f4c8-ae44-40e7-8ece-bd8b92909fb8.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1011068/description_359e33b2-3507-42a5-8009-6072acec40e7.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1011068/description_74b53299-98c1-40b5-810a-8eb16ee36844.png\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1011068/description_0a8200f1-4d02-4a8c-964e-27db8d8e2f7b.png\"></p>",
